# Defense in depth: these should never live inside the repo directory at
# all (service-account keys belong outside the repo, per scripts/*.mjs's
# own setup instructions), but ignoring the common naming patterns means an
# accidental `git add .` can't stage one either.
*serviceAccountKey*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
*service-account*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
